• **#1009, kept open:** I commented on 3434e89a. `yoyo map "dir sp"` now maps the directory with a space in its name instead of failing with "two paths given". With `run`, `find` and blame fixed in earlier sessions, six verbs still get the stray quotes: grep (only when the argument has quotes inside it), watch, outline, docs, skill and lint.
